{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relatable Workplace Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ordinary packaging shift turns tense when a boundary-crossing co-worker keeps testing how far you\u2019ll bend.</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anti-Dating Sim // Choices Matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every yes, <strong>NO</strong>, or awkward silence shifts the relationships and power balance.</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your approach unlocks several possible outcomes, from a strained farewell to a chilling finale.</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror, No Cheap Jumpscares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear comes from silence, hostile stares, and the feeling of being cornered.</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on True Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, this shit really happened to me, and living through it was awkward as hell.</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but Unsettling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-hour playthroughs make it easy to experiment with different boundaries and endings.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You've Been Warned!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3706160/27bf154b71e676eb433dc6ac7b3cdff669f099a3.jpg"},{"name":"Job Application","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3706160/3a79780e0b75f1bb7809233bdf6d7641ea71bc52.jpg"},{"name":"First Shift Speedrun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3706160/2687c3fd9376